## wiki_wspace skills

This project keeps rationale, architecture, decisions, QA constraints, glossary terms, and reusable lessons in `{{ wiki_root }}/`.

- Use `{{ query_command }}` before broad exploration when a task depends on why the system behaves as it does, business context, configuration semantics, prior decisions, constraints, or known failure modes.
- Use `{{ refresh_command }}` after code, configuration, tests, or documentation change project semantics.
- Both commands use the installed Agent Skills. The query skill calls `wiki_wspace search`, which uses qmd when available and otherwise performs index-based Markdown search.
- Never inspect `{{ wiki_root }}/stage/` unless the user names an exact file path there.
